abstract: >
  Complete source code, evaluation data, and figures for a verification-first
  RAG architecture for MPCVD single-crystal diamond growth. Includes a
  6-stage pipeline, CVD diamond question set, claim-verification benchmark,
  scientist evaluation scores, and reproducible statistics scripts.
